<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f2f6fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937; }
  .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 24px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5eaf2; }
  .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #115e59); padding: 28px 32px; color: #ffffff; }
  .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 23px; }
  .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #c9f5ef; }
  .content { padding: 30px 32px; }
  .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .notice { background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #fdba74; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 18px 0; color: #7c2d12; font-size: 14px; }
  .context { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 18px 0; }
  .context table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .context td { padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 14px; }
  .context tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .label { color: #64748b; }
  .value { color: #111827; font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
  .comment-box { background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 12px 0 20px; font-style: italic; color: #374151; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 10px 0 0; text-decoration: none; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .btn-primary { background: #0f766e; color: #ffffff !important; }
  .btn-secondary { background: #eef2f7; color: #0f172a !important; border: 1px solid #d9e2ef; }
  .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e8edf4; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Payment Review Required</h1>
    <p>RentIt Property Management &bull; Landlord / Approver Notification</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>A tenant has submitted a rent payment. Please review this submission promptly so the tenant's account and invoice status remain accurate.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Action needed:</strong> Please approve or reject this payment after reviewing its details and evidence.</div>
    <div class="context">
      <table>
        <tr><td class="label">Payment Reference</td><td class="value">{!Payment__c.Name}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Invoice Number</td><td class="value">{!Payment__c.Invoice__r.Name}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Invoice Due Date</td><td class="value">{!Payment__c.Invoice__r.Due_Date__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Amount Submitted</td><td class="value">${!Payment__c.Amount__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Payment Date</td><td class="value">{!Payment__c.Payment_Date__c}</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="label">Payer Reference</td><td class="value">{!Payment__c.Payment_Reference__c}</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p><strong>Tenant Comment:</strong></p>
    <div class="comment-box">{!Payment__c.Comment__c}</div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{!Community_URL}s/detail/{!Payment__c.Id}">Review Payment</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{!Community_URL}s/detail/{!Payment__c.Invoice__c}">View Invoice</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    RentIt Property Management &bull; Automated email, please do not reply.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>